    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Grab and Run </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get as many materials as you can by chaining enemy kills, blowing things up, and finding secrets. Once you've got as much as you dare, extract with your loot- just don't get pinched before the timer elapses or you'll drop it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Explore </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every handcrafted stage is packed with secret branches to discover, each one brimming with new materials, blueprints, and enemies. Explore windswept beaches, hidden lava caves, abandoned laboratories, frozen mountains, and more. Smart use of your new weapons to open the way and a sharp eye will be required to uncover them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft 30 different weapons and 20 other upgrades with the materials you find. With elemental weapons you can use wind to move boulders, cool down fire enemies with water, carve through rocks with the drill, and more. Taking on all of Crater City's challenges will require picking the right tools for each job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using everything you've built up, defeat tough bosses for your ultimate reward: meteor shards. Collect enough to unlock new stages with even greater challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Grab and Run </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get as many materials as you can by chaining enemy kills, blowing things up, and finding secrets. Once you've got as much as you dare, extract with your loot- just don't get pinched before the timer elapses or you'll drop it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/c370b136ccbae91250306e213e5270ce.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Explore </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every handcrafted stage is packed with secret branches to discover, each one brimming with new materials, blueprints, and enemies. Explore windswept beaches, hidden lava caves, abandoned laboratories, frozen mountains, and more. Smart use of your new weapons to open the way and a sharp eye will be required to uncover them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/5d5024ddfbcc0ed4a2ada0ce71298ea1.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft 30 different weapons and 20 other upgrades with the materials you find. With elemental weapons you can use wind to move boulders, cool down fire enemies with water, carve through rocks with the drill, and more. Taking on all of Crater City's challenges will require picking the right tools for each job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/f0ab96582f7bfa2d1f125341e781d83f.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using everything you've built up, defeat tough bosses for your ultimate reward: meteor shards. Collect enough to unlock new stages with even greater challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.poster.avif?t=1753917826\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.webm?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831900/extras/941364b3b4ec4a41a82b33c67e2d0422.mp4?t=1753917826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hop on a flying crab and go on an adventure that blends exploring intricate branching stages with blistering shoot 'em up action. Gather upgrade materials, escape with the goods, discover hidden areas, and take down 15 unique bosses to save Crater City.",
